# Hanzi AI

## Pipeline (do not skip steps)

```
provider → hanziPreNormalize → parseHanziDraft → validateHanziAnalysis → applyHanziTrustPolicy → v2 cache
```

Single validation gate: `validateHanziAnalysis()` in `hanziAnalysisValidator.ts`.

## Trust & versions

- Curated claims / forbidden decompositions: `hanziTrustRegistry.ts`
- Policy transform: `hanziTrustPolicy.ts`
- Bump `HANZI_TRUST_POLICY_VERSION` or `HANZI_TRUST_REGISTRY_VERSION` when changing trust rules
- After bump: update golden cases in `src/lib/harness/hanziGoldenCases.ts`, run `npm run harness:hanzi`

## Schema

- Draft input: `schemaVersion: 1` (`HanziAiDraftResult`)
- Published cache: `schemaVersion: 2` (`HanziAnalysisResult`)
- Do not change schema versions casually — update `hanziSchemaRegistry.ts` and all validators

## Constraints

- AI output never writes to `CnWord`, `CnHanzi`, or SRS
- Production needs PM2 `instances=1` (in-memory rate limits)
- Repair loop: max 2 attempts in `hanziAnalysisService.ts`

## Testing

- Offline golden cases: `src/lib/harness/` + `npm run harness:hanzi`
- Fixtures: `hanziFixtures.ts` (`baseDraft`, `draftCharRow`)
- Live eval: `npm run hanzi:batch` (manual, costs API)
